{
  "about": "Every tool on resources.mismo.org that has its own access, in the order the admin panel shows them. The admin panel's People & Access and every account menu read this one list: add a tool here (and to _internal/projects.json for the relay) and both show it. key is the relay project key; also lists keys always given the same access (never shown on their own); path is where the tool lives, for links and for knowing which tool a page belongs to; family marks tools shown together under one heading with an \"every one\" control in the admin panel (the Service Orders companies); menu is the name shown in the account menu when label alone would be unclear. A company's \"— Hours Only\" key is the SAME portal with a different permission: it reads orders-public/, which carries no rate and no fee, and writes only that person's hours. Give a facilitator Edit on the Hours Only row and No access on the company's own row — never both, or they keep the rates.",
